@startuml
actor Creator
participant "Expense Application" as App
participant "Domain Rules" as Domain
participant "Repository / Tx" as DB
participant "Notification" as Notice
Creator -> App: submit expense details
App -> Domain: validate membership, split, shares
Domain --> App: immutable share snapshot / errors
App -> DB: save SUBMITTED + shares + audit
App -> Notice: persist in-app review notices
App --> Creator: submitted
Creator -> App: approve/reject (authorized reviewer)
App -> DB: version check + decision + audit
alt approved
  App -> DB: activate obligations atomically
else rejected
  App -> DB: retain rejected state; no balance effect
end
App --> Creator: resulting state
@enduml
